# Product Launch


Everything required to prepare the product for public release.

- [-] Research
  Understand who we are building for and what already exists.
  - [x] Define target audience
  - [-] Review competitive landscape
    Capture pricing, positioning, and gaps worth exploiting.
    - [ ] Summarise the pricing study
- [ ] Design
  - [ ] Map information architecture
  - [x] Hand off design tokens
  - [ ] Polish the empty states
- [-] Engineering
  Ship the core product paths needed for a public launch.
  - [x] Set up the CI pipeline
  - [-] Implement onboarding flow
    Guide a new user from signup to their first successful action.
    - [x] Wire up the API
    - [ ] Add the welcome screen
  - [ ] Integrate billing
- [ ] Launch
  - [ ] Draft the announcement post
  - [ ] Brief the support team
